{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《美食強人》評審過程雖然充滿火藥味，但一眾主持與嘉賓卻頻頻製造笑料，緩和緊張氣氛！當中樊亦敏竟自爆試食時會出動探熱槍和電子磅兩大「法寶」，專業程度令人咋舌，卻引來黃永幟（幟哥）當場抱怨，場面爆笑！幸好有陳豪、陳浚霆大玩食字Gag，成功為現場降溫，究竟發生了甚麼事？\n</p>\n<h2>樊亦敏試食出動兩大法寶 幟哥寸爆：唔做你生意</h2>\n<p>在節目中，樊亦敏分享她獨特的試食習慣，竟然會隨身攜帶探熱槍和電子磅。她解釋道：「睇吓個餸嚟到夠唔夠熱」，以及「會秤吓外賣同堂食係咪一樣。」其後她給予其中一間食店「Bye」，原因竟是她即場為咕嚕肉「磅重」後，發現外賣份量比堂食大。此舉令身旁的幟哥忍不住笑著吐槽：「咁麻煩，我唔做你生意呀！食餐飯又磅又探熱針，唉！唔好搞我。」林秀怡見狀即刻勸交：「冷靜啲。」三人互動笑翻全場。</p>\n<h2>陳豪解構「初戀咕嚕肉」 爛Gag搓戀論笑爆全場</h2>\n<p>眼見現場氣氛因評分而變得緊張，陳豪隨即發揮其搞笑本色。當眾人討論廣州得獎菜式「初戀咕嚕肉」的菜名是否貼切時，陳豪突然發表「偉論」，對「初戀」作出全新解讀：「初戀嘅意思即係咩呢？即係『搓』呀，好鍾意搓咪『搓戀（初戀）』囉！」他更邊說邊生動地做出「搓」的動作，這個出其不意的爛Gag成功引得全場拍掌大笑，瞬間化解了緊張氣氛。</p>\n<h2>陳浚霆急才Gag獲激讚 「高級Gag」化解尷尬</h2>\n<p>除了陳豪，陳浚霆亦展現其過人急才。當評審黃隆滔分享自己光顧某食店兩次，第一次因大廚外出比賽只能吃到咕嚕蝦，第二次才成功吃到咕嚕肉時，另一評審西Dorsi則笑言自己光顧時「完全冇蝦，淨係得肉。」場面略帶尷尬之際，陳浚霆馬上接話：「佢唔想侮（冇）辱（肉）你，所以咪畀啲肉你囉！」這個食字Gag引得全場捧腹大笑，林秀怡更激讚這是「高級Gag」！</p>\n<h2>網民大讚互動夠真：「呢啲先好笑！」</h2>\n<p>節目中的搞笑互動引來網民熱議，不少觀眾都大讚主持與嘉賓之間的化學作用。有網民留言：「樊亦敏真係好專業，但幟哥反應笑死！」、「陳豪啲爛gag雖然爛，但真係好有佢嘅風格！」、「陳浚霆轉數好快，個『侮辱』gag好絕！」、「成班人化學作用好好，睇佢哋鬥嘴仲好笑過食嘢！」、「呢啲先係真人騷，夠真夠貼地！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/04_13390135586ae0371356cdd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/04_13390135586ae0371356cdd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05_535936306ae03716d61af.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05_535936306ae03716d61af.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_7281822326ae0372d18f73.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_7281822326ae0372d18f73.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_19183808776ae0373c3a244.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_19183808776ae0373c3a244.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_1613121556ae037404093a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_1613121556ae037404093a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:21:38.773315+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1162,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T14:00:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:40.873791+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:45.795109+00:00","content_hash":"a6338d378d692819197a53e7c6ebece06030881bd7bb4a8de309a6837e95b8e8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}